  "description": "Strategic pitch-deck plugin auto-generated from schemas/pitch-deck.schema.v2.ts via @fdpm/zod-bridge. Models 8 entities (Audience, Source, DataPoint, StrategicClaim, Risk, Competitor, AntiPattern, Slide) and 8 cross-entity relations. Cross-deck invariants (audience coverage, time budget, source freshness, displayNumber contiguity) lift to a deck-coherence cap:validator. The four optional capabilities (renderer / importer / exporter / expr-helper) are derived per Entity by the bridge.",
  "host_compatibility": {
    "fdpm": ">=1.1,<2"
  },
